{{pagebanner|Aioi Wikivoyage banner.jpg|Caption=Aioi Peron Festival}} '''Aioi''' (相生) is a small port city in western [[Hyogo]].
==Understand== ===Tourist information site=== The local tourist association has a [https://aioi.in/ Japanese-only guide site]. [https://aioi.in/pamphlet-2/ Its Pamphlet section] has a guide map in English.
==Get in== {{Mapframe|zoom=auto}} {{mapshape}}
Aioi Station is served by the Sanyo Shinkansen. The JR Sanyo Main Line and the Ako Line also run through Aioi.
